@title Cabinet: ducts that cross each other are an Issues finding
@area Cabinet
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# qa/fixtures/cabinet-crossing-ducts.novo is the older Place all result: the trunk duct runs through the five
# row ducts. The "5 errors" pill (Check > Issues) lists "Duct N crosses duct M" and says how to fix it.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-crossing-ducts.novo
wait 20
click_text Cabinet #1
wait 30
shot plate
click_text "5 errors"
wait 20
expect "crosses duct"
shot problems
check_layout
